    "outcome": {
      "status": "complete",
      "headline": "The Novakai Messaging rebuild is finished: all four slices sealed, all six proof scenarios passing, 253 of 253 tests green.",
      "summary": "This session built the whole messaging capability from the frozen contracts: direct messages, rooms, push subscriptions, templates, two storage adapters, three transport adapters, and a standalone WebSocket mode for external chiefs. Every slice was pressure-tested by a fresh zero-context auditor before it was sealed, and every finding was fixed at the source with a regression test. The work is merged to main via PR #59."
    },
